    "abstract": "The invention provides a method for forming a polysilicon resistor device and a semiconductor device. In one embodiment, the method includes forming a dummy gate stack in a first region of a substrate, wherein the dummy gate stack has a dummy gate stack thickness. And forming a polysilicon resistor in the second region of the substrate, wherein the polysilicon resistor has a polysilicon resistor thickness, and the distance is less than the thickness of the dummy gate stack. Dopants are implanted into the first region of the substrate to form source/drain regions. And implanting dopant into the polysilicon resistor. An interlevel dielectric layer is formed over the dummy gate stack and the polysilicon resistor and planarized to expose the dummy gate stack and leave a portion of the interlevel dielectric layer over the polysilicon resistor. The dummy gate stack is replaced by a high-k metal gate and the inter-layer dielectric layer is used as a mask to protect the polysilicon resistor. The present invention can reduce the complexity and expense of the manufacturing process.",
