    "abstract": "本发明公开了永磁同步电机的变指数系数趋近律滑模变结构控制方法。针对高性能永磁同步电机控制系统的要求，在常规指数趋近律的基础上，引入变指数函数项将系统状态变量的一阶范数作为指数函数的指数，根据系统距离滑模面的远近，自适应调节变指数项的趋近速度和变速项的趋近速度，有利于增加系统的动态响应速度。以系统状态变量的一阶范数作为函数的指数，关联了系统状态变量；为进一步抑制系统抖振，引入s函数代替符号函数。从而提出了一种变指数系数趋近律的永磁同步电机滑模变结构控制方法。与积分型滑模变结构控制方法相比，该方法有效地提高了系统的动态特性和稳态特性，并增加了系统的鲁棒性。 The invention discloses a sliding mode variable structure control method of a permanent magnet synchronous motor with variable exponent coefficient reaching law. According to the requirements of the high-performance permanent magnet synchronous motor control system, on the basis of the conventional exponential reaching law, the variable exponential function term is introduced The first-order norm of the system state variable is used as the index of the exponential function, and according to the distance between the system and the sliding surface, the approach speed of the variable index item and the approach speed of the variable speed item are adaptively adjusted, which is conducive to increasing the dynamic response speed of the system . The first-order norm of the system state variables is used as the exponent of the function, and the system state variables are associated; in order to further suppress system chattering, the s-function is introduced instead of the sign function. Therefore, a sliding mode variable structure control method for permanent magnet synchronous motor with variable exponent coefficient reaching law is proposed. Compared with the integral sliding mode variable structure control method, this method effectively improves the dynamic characteristics and steady-state characteristics of the system, and increases the robustness of the system.",
