    "abstract": "本发明涉及一种基于干扰观测器的永磁同步电机自适应非奇异终端滑模控制方法，在永磁同步电机矢量控制系统的速度环，引入自适应非奇异终端滑模控制器，其特征在于，提出一种自适应变速指数趋近律，该趋近律引入状态变量的一阶范数，根据状态变量距离平衡点的远近自适应调整指数趋近速度与等速趋近速度，从而实现缩短趋近时间的同时削弱系统抖振。同时，针对系统外部干扰以及负载扰动问题，设计了干扰观测器，并将其观测值反馈到滑模控制器的设计中。本发明在系统受到干扰以及负载出现波动时，能快速地跟踪转速，减小系统超调及稳态静差，大大增强了系统的鲁棒性。 The invention relates to an adaptive non-singular terminal sliding mode control method for a permanent magnet synchronous motor based on a disturbance observer. In the speed loop of the permanent magnet synchronous motor vector control system, an adaptive non-singular terminal sliding mode controller is introduced, which is characterized in that , an adaptive variable speed exponential approach law is proposed, the approach law introduces the first-order norm of the state variable, and adjusts the exponential approach speed and the constant speed approach speed adaptively according to the distance between the state variable and the equilibrium point, so as to realize the shortening Reduce system chattering while approaching time. At the same time, for the system external disturbance and load disturbance, a disturbance observer is designed, and its observed value is fed back to the design of the sliding mode controller. When the system is disturbed and the load fluctuates, the invention can quickly track the rotating speed, reduce the system overshoot and steady-state static error, and greatly enhance the robustness of the system.",
