    "abstract": "本发明涉及一种基于干扰观测器的永磁同步电机自适应非奇异终端滑模控制方法，在永磁同步电机矢量控制系统的速度环，引入自适应非奇异终端滑模控制器，其特征在于，提出一种自适应变速指数趋近律，该趋近律引入状态变量的一阶范数，根据状态变量距离平衡点的远近自适应调整指数趋近速度与等速趋近速度，从而实现缩短趋近时间的同时削弱系统抖振。同时，针对系统外部干扰以及负载扰动问题，设计了干扰观测器，并将其观测值反馈到滑模控制器的设计中。本发明在系统受到干扰以及负载出现波动时，能快速地跟踪转速，减小系统超调及稳态静差，大大增强了系统的鲁棒性。 The invention relates to an adaptive non-singular terminal sliding mode control method for a permanent magnet synchronous motor based on a disturbance observer. An adaptive non-singular terminal sliding mode controller is introduced into a speed loop of a vector control system of the permanent magnet synchronous motor. , an adaptive variable speed exponential approach law is proposed, which introduces the first-order norm of the state variable, and adaptively adjusts the exponential approach speed and the constant speed approach speed according to the distance between the state variable and the equilibrium point, so as to achieve shortening At the same time, the buffeting of the system is reduced as the time is approached. At the same time, a disturbance observer is designed for the external disturbance and load disturbance of the system, and its observations are fed back to the design of the sliding mode controller. When the system is disturbed and the load fluctuates, the invention can quickly track the rotational speed, reduce the overshoot and the steady-state static error of the system, and greatly enhance the robustness of the system.",
