    "abstract": "本发明提出一种超高速永磁同步电机转速自适应鲁棒控制方法。在计算电磁转矩Te *时运用鲁棒控制中的鲁棒控制律设计控制量，并运用自适应控制中的自适应率在线辨识负载转矩，将鲁棒控制和自适应控制结合，使电机在运行时稳定性强、抗负载扰动；采用自适应率在线辨识得到负载转矩，降低高速情况下的负载转矩扰动对系统性能的影响；通过鲁棒控制中的模型补偿量和鲁棒反馈量来抑制高速情况下的包括建模误差和不确定干扰等未知非线性因素对系统的影响，保证控制系统的鲁棒性。 The invention proposes an adaptive robust control method for the rotational speed of an ultra-high-speed permanent magnet synchronous motor. When calculating the electromagnetic torque T e * , the robust control law in the robust control is used to design the control quantity, and the adaptive rate in the adaptive control is used to identify the load torque online, and the robust control and the adaptive control are combined to make the The motor has strong stability during operation and is resistant to load disturbance; the load torque is obtained by online identification of the adaptive rate, which reduces the influence of the load torque disturbance on the system performance at high speed; through the model compensation and robustness in robust control The feedback amount is used to suppress the influence of unknown nonlinear factors including modeling errors and uncertain disturbances on the system under high-speed conditions, so as to ensure the robustness of the control system.",
