    "abstract": "A method of forming a semiconductor structure, comprising: forming a plurality of fins disposed over a top surface of a substrate; and forming one or more Vertical Transfer Field Effect Transistors (VTFETs) from the plurality of fins using a Replacement Metal Gate (RMG) process. A gate surrounding at least one fin of a given VTFET of the VTFETs includes a gate self-aligned contact (SAC) cap layer disposed over a gate contact metal layer disposed adjacent to an end of the at least one fin.",
