    "where": "China",
    "abstract": "The invention discloses a leakage current-based weak physical unclonable function circuit, which comprises a decoder, m level converters and a PUF core circuit, wherein the PUF core circuit comprises z pre-charge sensitive amplifiers, z latches and z PUF unit column circuits, each pre-charge sensitive amplifier comprises a first PMOS (P-channel metal oxide semiconductor) tube, a second PMOS tube, a third PMOS tube, a fourth PMOS tube, a fifth PMOS tube, a first NMOS (N-channel metal oxide semiconductor) tube and a second NMOS tube, each PUF unit column circuit comprises m PUF units, each PUF unit only comprises 2 minimum-size NMOS (N-channel metal oxide semiconductor) tubes, the PUF units are biased in a subthreshold region by subthreshold bias voltage VBB, the leakage current of the PUF units controlled by the subthreshold bias voltage VBB has larger deviation, and the leakage current can obtain a high-stability output key through the pre-charge sensitive amplifiers connected with the PUF units; the advantage is that the area is less, and output stability is higher.",
