    "skim": "Memristive neural network computing engine using CMOS-compatible charge-trap-transistor (CTT)",
    "title": "Memristive neural network computing engine using CMOS-compatible charge-trap-transistor (CTT)",
    "holder": "University of California San Diego UCSD",
