    "filed": "2022-03-28",
    "published": "2022-07-07",
    "where": "United States",
    "abstract": "The present disclosure provides a method that includes providing a semiconductor substrate having a first region and a second region; forming a first gate within the first region and a second gate within the second region on the semiconductor substrate; forming first source/drain features of a first semiconductor material with an n-type dopant in the semiconductor substrate within the first region; forming second source/drain features of a second semiconductor material with a p-type dopant in the semiconductor substrate within the second region. The second semiconductor material is different from the first semiconductor material in composition. The method further includes forming first silicide features to the first source/drain features and second silicide features to the second source/drain features; and performing an ion implantation process of a species to both the first and second regions, thereby introducing the species to first silicide features and the second source/drain features.",
    "claims": [
      "1. A device comprising: a first source/drain feature disposed on a substrate, the first source/drain feature including a first semiconductor material with a first type dopant; a second source/drain feature disposed on the substrate, the second source/drain feature including a second semiconductor material with a second type dopant that is opposite the first type dopant; a first silicide feature disposed on the first source/drain feature, the first silicide feature including a doping species at a first concentration; and a second silicide feature disposed on the second source/drain feature, the second silicide feature including the doping species at a second concertation that is less than the first concentration.",
      "2. The device of claim 1, wherein the first semiconductor material is formed of a different material than the second semiconductor material.",
      "3. The device of claim 1, wherein the first semiconductor material includes silicon and the second semiconductor material includes germanium.",
      "4. The device of claim 1, wherein the first source/drain feature and the second source/drain feature include the doping species.",
      "5. The device of claim 4, wherein the doping species is formed of a different material than the first type dopant and the second type dopant.",
      "6. The device of claim 4, wherein the doping species extends to a first depth within the first source/drain feature and a second depth within the second source/drain feature, the second depth being different than the first depth.",
      "7. The device of claim 4, wherein the doping species has a greater concentration in the first silicide feature than the first source/drain feature.",
      "8. The device of claim 4, wherein the doping species has a greater concentration in the second source/drain feature than the silicide feature.",
      "9. A device comprising: a first source/drain feature disposed on a substrate, the first source/drain feature including a first semiconductor material with a first type dopant; a second source/drain feature disposed on the substrate, the second source/drain feature including a second semiconductor material with a second type dopant, the second type dopant being opposite conductivity of the first type dopant, wherein the second source/drain feature further includes a doping species substantially distributed in the second source/drain feature; a first silicide feature disposed on the first source/drain feature, the first silicide feature including the doping species substantially distributed in the first silicide feature; and a second silicide feature disposed on the second source/drain feature.",
      "10. The device of claim 9, wherein the doping species includes a metal material, and wherein the first type dopant in a n-type dopant and the second type dopant is a p-type dopant.",
      "11. The device of claim 10, wherein the metal material is selected from the group consisting of Ytterbium (Yb), Erbium (Er), Yttrium (Y), Selenium (Se), Platinum (Pt) and Barium (Ba).",
      "12. The device of claim 10, wherein the selected metal material is Ytterbium (Yb).",
      "13. The device of claim 9, wherein the first silicide feature includes titanium (Ti).",
      "14. The device of claim 9, wherein the first silicide feature includes cobalt (Co).",
      "15. The device of claim 9, wherein the second source/drain feature has a greater concentration of the doping species than the first source drain feature, and wherein the first silicide feature has a greater concentration of the doping species than the second silicide feature.",
      "16. A device comprising: a first region that includes a first source/drain feature and a first silicide feature disposed thereon, wherein the first source/drain feature includes a first semiconductor material with a first type dopant and a metal doping species, wherein the first silicide feature includes the metal doping species such that metal doping species is substantially distributed within the first silicide feature in the first region; and a second region that includes a second source/drain feature and a second silicide feature disposed thereon, wherein the second source/drain feature includes a second semiconductor material with a second type dopant and the metal doping species, the second type dopant being opposite conductivity of the first type dopant, wherein the second silicide feature includes the metal doping species and the metal doping species is substantially distributed within the second source/drain feature in the second region.",
      "17. The device of claim 16, wherein the first source/drain feature has a bottom surface and the metal doping species is spaced apart a first distance from the bottom surface of the first source/drain feature, and wherein the second source/drain feature has a bottom surface and the metal doping species is spaced apart a second distance from the bottom surface of the second source/drain feature, the second distance being different than the first distance.",
      "18. The device of claim 16, wherein the first type dopant is a n-type dopant and the second type dopant is a p-type dopant.",
      "19. The device of claim 16, wherein the first region further includes a first fin structure and the first source/drain feature and the first silicide feature are associated with the first fin structure, and wherein the second region further includes a second fin structure and the second source/drain feature and the second silicide feature are associated with the second fin structure.",
      "20. The device of claim 16, wherein the metal doping species being substantially distributed within the first silicide feature in the first region includes more than 70% of the concentration of the metal doping species within the first region being within the first silicide feature, and wherein the metal doping species being substantially distributed within the second source/drain feature in the second region includes more than 70% of the concentration of the metal doping species within the second region being within the second source/drain feature."
    ],
